CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F305A1785111491
OL,3,CTwo-thirds of adults 'spend time
OL,4,Cworrying about money during a typical
OL,5,Cweek'
OL,7,FNearly two-thirds (65%) of adults
OL,8,Fspend time worrying about money during
OL,9,Fa typical week, a survey has indicated.
OL,11,FThose affected spend an average of
OL,12,Faround 22 hours per week thinking
OL,13,Fabout issues such as whether bills are
OL,14,Fcovered, checking balances and
OL,15,Fwondering whether their money will
OL,16,Flast, according to the research
OL,17,Fcommissioned by the thinkmoney app.
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G1/12
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNat News CNat TV FClean Feed
FL,306,300,200,140,000,100
PN,30502
SC,0002
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F305A1785111491
OL,3,CTwo-thirds of adults 'spend time
OL,4,Cworrying about money during a typical
OL,5,Cweek'
OL,7,FPeople in the North East of England
OL,8,Fwho worry about money were found to
OL,9,Fspend the longest time, averaging 26.6
OL,10,Fhours a week.
OL,12,FThey are followed by the people in the
OL,13,FNorth West of England (24.6 hours) and
OL,14,Fthe South West (24.0 hours).
OL,16,FThose surveyed in Scotland were found
OL,17,Fto spend the least amount of time
OL,18,Fworrying at 17.3 hours.
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G2/12
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNat News CNat TV FClean Feed
FL,306,300,200,140,000,100
PN,30503
