CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F305A1785111491
OL,3,CTwo-thirds of adults 'spend time
OL,4,Cworrying about money during a typical
OL,5,Cweek'
OL,7,FPeople in households earning less than
OL,8,F#15,000 spend around 13 hours more a
OL,9,Fweek worrying about money than those
OL,10,Fearning more than #100,000, according
OL,11,Fto the research carried out among more
OL,12,Fthan 2,000 people across the UK in
OL,13,FJune.
OL,15,FPeople in households earning less than
OL,16,F#15,000 who worry about money spend an
OL,17,Faverage of 29.2 hours a week with
OL,18,Ffinances weighing on their minds,
OL,19,Fwhile those in households earning more
OL,20,Fthan #100,000 average 16.2 hours.
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G3/12
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNat News CNat TV FClean Feed
FL,306,300,200,140,000,100
PN,30504
SC,0004
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F305A1785111491
OL,3,CTwo-thirds of adults 'spend time
OL,4,Cworrying about money during a typical
OL,5,Cweek'
OL,7,FMore than three in 10 (31%) people
OL,8,Fsaid they had cut back on food,
OL,9,Fheating or other essentials because of
OL,10,Fmoney worries.
OL,12,FMore than a quarter (28%) said they
OL,13,Fhad checked their bank balance
OL,14,Fmultiple times in a single day looking
OL,15,Ffor reassurance.
OL,17,FBy contrast, 17% had avoided checking
OL,18,Ftheir balance because they were
OL,19,Fworried to look at it, while 13% had
OL,20,Favoided opening bills, letters, emails
OL,21,For banking apps.
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G4/12
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNat News CNat TV FClean Feed
FL,306,300,200,140,000,100
PN,30505
SC,0005
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F305A1785111491
OL,3,CTwo-thirds of adults 'spend time
OL,4,Cworrying about money during a typical
OL,5,Cweek'
OL,7,FThe research also found that the
OL,8,Fimpact of financial concerns goes
OL,9,Fbeyond bank balances.
OL,11,FThree in 10 (30%) people said worrying
OL,12,Fabout money had stopped them making
OL,13,Fplans for the future during the past
OL,14,Fyear.
OL,16,FMore than a quarter (28%) said it had
OL,17,Faffected their confidence around
OL,18,Feveryday spending, and the same
OL,19,Fproportion (28%) said it had stopped
OL,20,Fthem feeling in control of their lives.
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G5/12
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNat News CNat TV FClean Feed
FL,306,300,200,140,000,100
PN,30506
SC,0006
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F305A1785111491
OL,3,CTwo-thirds of adults 'spend time
OL,4,Cworrying about money during a typical
OL,5,Cweek'
OL,7,FMore than one in four (26%) said money
OL,8,Fworries had made it harder to relax
OL,9,Fduring their free time.
OL,11,FMore than a fifth (21%) said money
OL,12,Fworries had stopped them seeing
OL,13,Ffriends or family as often as they
OL,14,Fwould like and 17% said financial
OL,15,Fconcerns had prevented them being
OL,16,Ffully present with friends or family.
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G6/12
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNat News CNat TV FClean Feed
FL,306,300,200,140,000,100
PN,30507
SC,0007
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F305A1785111491
OL,3,CTwo-thirds of adults 'spend time
OL,4,Cworrying about money during a typical
OL,5,Cweek'
OL,7,FVix Leyton, a consumer expert at
OL,8,Fthinkmoney, said: "We often measure
OL,9,Fmoney problems in pounds and pence,
OL,10,Fbut this research suggests the real
OL,11,Fcost is something much more valuable `
OL,12,Four time and attention.
OL,14,F"Twenty-two hours isn't just a
OL,15,Fstatistic; it's the parent mentally
OL,16,Fadding up the supermarket shop before
OL,17,Fthey've reached the checkout and not
OL,18,Fenjoying their toddler singing in the
OL,19,Ftrolley.
OL,26,@pD@SOUvD@AOU
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G7/12
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNat News CNat TV FClean Feed
FL,306,300,200,140,000,100
PN,30508
SC,0008
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F305A1785111491
OL,3,CTwo-thirds of adults 'spend time
OL,4,Cworrying about money during a typical
OL,5,Cweek'
OL,7,F"It's someone checking their banking
OL,8,Fapp for the fourth time that day even
OL,9,Fthough they know nothing has changed,
OL,10,Ftrying to enjoy dinner with your
OL,11,Ffriends while part of your brain is
OL,12,Fstill working out whether the bill
OL,13,Fwill knock you off course.
OL,15,F"When you look at the wider findings,
OL,16,Fyou can see how that pressure spills
OL,17,Finto the rest of people's lives.
OL,26,@oD@AOUwD@AOU
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G8/12
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNat News CNat TV FClean Feed
FL,306,300,200,140,000,100
PN,30509
SC,0009
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F305A1785111491
OL,3,CTwo-thirds of adults 'spend time
OL,4,Cworrying about money during a typical
OL,5,Cweek'
OL,7,F"It stops people making plans, affects
OL,8,Fconfidence, changes how people spend
OL,9,Ftheir free time and, for some, even
OL,10,Fchanges how they interact with the
OL,11,Fpeople closest to them.
OL,13,F"What really struck me was that people
OL,14,Frespond to uncertainty in completely
OL,15,Fdifferent ways.
OL,17,F"Some check their balance over and
OL,18,Fover again looking for reassurance,
OL,19,Fand others avoid opening their banking
OL,20,Fapp because they're frightened of what
OL,21,Fthey'll find.
OL,26,@oD@AOUuD@AOUyD@AOU
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G9/12
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNat News CNat TV FClean Feed
FL,306,300,200,140,000,100
PN,30510
SC,0010
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F305A1785111491
OL,3,CTwo-thirds of adults 'spend time
OL,4,Cworrying about money during a typical
OL,5,Cweek'
OL,7,F"On the surface those behaviours
OL,8,Fcouldn't look more different, but
OL,9,Fthey're often driven by exactly the
OL,10,Fsame feeling ` not quite knowing where
OL,11,Fyou stand."
OL,13,FPeople who are concerned about
OL,14,Fbalancing their budget may find it
OL,15,Fuseful to use online budgeting tools,
OL,16,Fsuch as on the Government-backed
OL,17,FMoneyHelper website.
OL,26,@oD@AOUsD@KO]
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                   G10/12
