OL,3,CTwo-thirds of adults 'spend time
OL,4,Cworrying about money during a typical
OL,5,Cweek'
OL,7,FOpening bills and going through
OL,8,Fstatements can help people understand
OL,9,Ftheir financial position and avoid the
OL,10,Frisk of missed payments. There may
OL,11,Falso be some forgotten subscriptions
OL,12,Fin bank statements that people can
OL,13,Fcancel to help improve their financial
OL,14,Fposition.
OL,16,FThose who are struggling to pay back
OL,17,Fdebts may also want to consider
OL,18,Fspeaking to their lender to find out
OL,19,Fwhat options may be available.
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                   G11/12
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
