OL,3,CTwo-thirds of adults 'spend time
OL,4,Cworrying about money during a typical
OL,5,Cweek'
OL,7,FCharities such as StepChange, Citizens
OL,8,FAdvice and Christians Against Poverty
OL,9,Fmay also be able to provide support.
OL,11,FHere are the average numbers of hours
OL,12,Fthat people said they spend worrying
OL,13,Fabout money in a typical week, among
OL,14,Fthose who worry about money, according
OL,15,Fto thinkmoney:
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                   G12/12
